---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Start of Day Check-in | Tangible Therapy"} description={""} noindex>
<section class="sec t-light h-small has-div" style="--divh:2vw">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:10;--mrows:17">
  <div class="b b-html je" style="--d:1/5/4/23;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><div class="scaled"><span class="scaled-in"><h1>Start of Day Check-in</h1></span></div></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/2/7/26;--m:4/2/6/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center">Jump To:</h4></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:7/4/9/8;--m:6/4/8/8;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small btn-full" href="/scheduling-new-client#phone">Phone Call</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:7/8/9/12;--m:8/4/10/8;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small btn-full" href="/scheduling-new-client#email">Email</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:7/12/9/16;--m:10/4/12/8;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small btn-full" href="/scheduling-new-client#referral">Referral Tracker</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:7/16/9/21;--m:12/4/15/8;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small btn-full" href="/scheduling-new-client#scheduling">Getting Clients Scheduled</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:7/21/9/25;--m:15/4/17/8;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small btn-full" href="/scheduling-new-client#after">After Scheduling</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={2} width={20} fill="#fff" flipX flipY /></section>

<section class="sec t-white h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:22;--mrows:48">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/9/17;--m:1/2/32/10"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center">Start of day</h3><p>Check E-mails</p><p>Check Texts</p><p>Check new client paperwork</p><p>Check Daily Report, Openings</p><p></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:1/18/16/25;--m:32/2/49/10;--dz:4;--mz:2"><div class="shape" style="background:var(--shape);border-radius:40px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/18/5/25;--m:33/2/35/10;--dz:6;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">Insurances We Accept</span></h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/19/17/24;--m:35/2/48/10;--dz:5;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><ul><li><p><span class="c-white">Select Health med, share, value (Not signature)</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span class="c-white">DMBA</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-white">United</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-white">Regence</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-white">BCBS- blue cross blue shield </span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-white">PEHP</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-white">UMR</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-white">EMI</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-white">Aetna- only Arianne and Joe</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-white">Cigna -only Joe</span></p></li></ul></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:16;--mrows:11">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/8/12;--m:1/2/5/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Reaching out Via E-mail</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/12/13/25;--m:5/2/11/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Clients will reach out over email via Psychology today. Often when they do so they are looking for a specific therapist. If that therapist is available then offer times to schedule. If not, then apologize and offer to put them on a waitlist and then offer alternative therapists that work with the same diagnosis and who have current availability. Every email response should check to see if they have insurance that’s in network and let give the client options to book.  When they’re ready to schedule, be sure to get their full name, email and phone number.</p><p>ex. “I apologize but Emily’s caseload is currently full. Her waitlist is about 4 weeks out, I’d be happy to put you on her waitlist. I notice however that you mentioned OCD, we have two therapists Sarah and Joe who also specialize in that and have current openings. I think both of them could be a good fit for what youre looking for. Sarah has openings …. Joe has openings…. Let me know if you’d like to book with either of them.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white-bold h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:8;--mrows:12">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/9/4/19;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h1 class="ta-center">Referral Tracker</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/8/7/20;--m:4/2/10/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-accent">It’s important that we track each call we get to determine the effects of our marketing efforts. In order to help with that, please fill out the form via the link below each time a client contacts us, regardless of if they book or not.</span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:7/11/9/17;--m:10/4/12/8;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-tertiary btn-small btn-full" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdVu5bj8xJ42IwgJZXoNd7vbfPeQRs2sP6ggSPgYVSn71JdVg/viewform?usp=sf_link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Referral Tracker</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:12;--mrows:11">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/9/11/19;--m:2/2/9/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Once you’ve completed your call, it’s time to schedule. To learn how to schedule follow the link below.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:11/11/13/17;--m:9/4/11/8;--dz:8;--mz:7"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-large btn-full" href="https://support.simplepractice.com/hc/en-us/articles/210389463-Adding-and-managing-appointments" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scheduling</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white-bold h-small has-div" style="--divh:8vw">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:49;--mrows:61">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/2/8/10;--m:1/2/5/10;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h1>Client Scheduled, Now What?</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:8/7/11/23;--m:5/2/11/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-lightAccent">Once you have the client scheduled theres a few more things to do.</span></h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:11/1/19/27;--m:9/2/20/10;--dz:2;--mz:4"><div class="shape" style="background:var(--shape);border-radius:0px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:12/10/19/18;--m:10/3/37/9;--dz:4;--mz:5"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white"> 1. Text the Therapist</span></h4><p><span class="c-white">Send a message to the therapist with:</span></p><p><span class="c-white">• Client’s initials</span></p><p><span class="c-white">• Date &amp; time of the scheduled appointment</span></p><p><span class="c-white">• Any relevant details (presenting concerns, etc.)</span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:20/6/33/22;--m:21/2/48/10;--dz:5;--mz:6"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center">2. Send “Meet the Billing Team” Email</h4><p><span class="c-lightAccent">Draft an email to the client and CC: clientservices@myofficemanager.net</span></p><p><span class="c-lightAccent">Use this Template and send</span></p><p><span class="c-lightAccent">Hi (Insert Clients Name),<br/><br/>I hope this email finds you well!&nbsp; As you begin your work at Tangible we want your experience to be one where you can focus on healing, not headaches. That’s why we want to introduce you to our billing team, who will be your primary contacts for all billing-related matters. Our billing team is here to assist you with any questions or concerns you may have regarding cost of sessions, billing procedures, insurance claims, invoices, etc. Please feel free to reach out to them if ever you have questions or concerns related to billing and they will take care of you.<br/><br/><strong>Email: ClientServices@MyOfficeManager.net<br/>Phone: (385) 666-5544</strong></span><br/></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-shape jc" style="--d:34/1/50/27;--m:43/2/61/10;--dz:3;--mz:5"><div class="shape" style="background:var(--shape);border-radius:0px"></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:35/10/39/18;--m:44/2/47/10;--dz:6;--mz:7"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">3. Sign Client Up for Email Updates</span></h4><p></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-newsletter" style="--d:37/9/50/19;--m:46/2/62/10;--dz:7;--mz:8"><!-- unsupported block sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-newsletter newsletter-block website.components.newsletter --></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="scalloped" height={8} width={100} fill="#acb9ac" flipY /></section>
</Base>
